        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2015 MTV Video Music Awards\n- People: Taylor Swift\n- Works: \"Wildest Dreams\", 1989\n- Topics: music videos, dream pop, love ballads\n\nFacts:\n- The 2015 MTV Video Music Awards were held on August 30, 2015.\n- Taylor Swift's \"Wildest Dreams\" music video premiered during the pre-show of the 2015 MTV Video Music Awards.\n- \"Wildest Dreams\" is a song recorded by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift for her fifth studio album, 1989.\n- \"Wildest Dreams\" is musically a love ballad with a prominent dream pop influence.\n- The lyrics of \"Wildest Dreams\" describe Taylor Swift's plea for her lover to remember her.",
